api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/deployments","created_at":"2021-01-30T14:21:06Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T23:27:00Z","pushed_at":"2025-10-30T19:53:03Z","git_url":"git://github.com/rmagatti/auto-session.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:rmagatti/auto-session.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/rmagatti/auto-session.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/rmagatti/auto-session","homepage":"","size":996,"stargazers_count":1740,"watchers_count":1740,"language":"Lua","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":54,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":12,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["hacktoberfest","lua","neovim","neovim-plugin"],"visibility":"public","forks":54,"open_issues":12,"watchers":1740,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nauto-sessions throws an error if I open a session containing a file that's already open in another Neovim instance.\r\n\r\nMy guess is that this is related to [this issue](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/17397) where Neovim gives the `ATTENTION Found a swap file by the name...` even if `shortmess+=A` is set.\r\n\r\nHowever it seems that auto-session doesn't recover from this, since even if I press \"Edit anyway\" the session still doesn't get restored properly restored, and auto-session itself also throws additional errors.\r\n\r\nThis is the error message:\r\n\r\n```txt\r\n.../nvim/packages/auto-session/lua/auto-session-library.lua:189:         Error restoring session! The session might be corrupted.\r\nDisabling auto save. Please check for errors in your config. Error:\r\n\r\nVim(edit):E325: ATTENTION\r\nstack traceback:\r\n^I[C]: in function 'error'\r\n^I.../nvim/packages/auto-session/lua/auto-session-library.lua:189: in function 'error'\r\n^I.../.config/nvim/packages/auto-session/lua/auto-session.lua:327: in function 'restore'\r\n^I.../.config/nvim/packages/auto-session/lua/auto-session.lua:353: in function 'RestoreSession'\r\n^I.../.config/nvim/packages/auto-session/lua/auto-session.lua:290: in function <.../.config/nvim/packages/auto-session/lua/auto-session.lua:288>\r\n```\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\n1. Use the following config file `config.vim`:\r\n\r\n   ```vim\r\n   call plug#begin('~/.config/nvim/packages/')\r\n   Plug 'rmagatti/auto-session'\r\n   call plug#end()\r\n\r\n   set shortmess+=A\r\n\r\n   lua << EOF\r\n   require('auto-session').setup()\r\n   EOF\r\n   ```\r\n\r\n2. `nvim -u config.vim testfile.txt`\r\n3. `split testfile2.txt`\r\n4. `SaveSession`\r\n5. (in a new shell) `nvim -u config.vim`\r\n6. Neovim throws \"Found a swap file\" error, press `e` as in \"Edit anyway\"\r\n7. `RestoreSession testfile.txt`\r\n8. Neovim throws \"Found a swap file\", press `e`\r\n9. auto-session throws error and session isn't properly restored\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\r\nNeovim properly restores the session without any errors\r\n\r\n**Baseline (please complete the following information):**\r\n\r\n- Result of `set sessionoptions?`: `blank,buffers,curdir,folds,help,tabpages,winsize`\r\n- OS. e.g `uname -a`: `Linux 5.13.19-2-MANJARO #1 SMP PREEMPT Sun Sep 19 21:31:53 UTC 2021 x86_64 GNU/Linux`\r\n- Neovim version `nvim --version`: `NVIM v0.7.0-dev+1027-gf02a5a7bd`\r\n- URL to your current config (if public): https://github.com/Melkster/nvim/","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/issues/117/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rmagatti/auto-session/issues/117/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":6229072719,"node_id":"LE_lADOAPphoM5DuvJnzwAAAAFzSBtP","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/6229072719","actor":{"login":"zeertzjq","id":35768171,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY4MTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35768171?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq","html_url":"https://github.com/zeertzjq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/events{/